# List pages and dialogs (new UX)

Apply on Property-New, Finance-New, and other MPA screens. Do not change classic SPA pages unless asked.

## List screens

- Start every list with **summary boxes** (counts for the dataset). Clicking a box filters the list when that is meaningful.
- Keep **business actions** from the classic screen (add, import, export, refresh, delete, etc.). Change presentation, not capability.

## Header actions

- Prefer **icons with a tooltip**. Use a short label only when the action is primary (e.g. Add).
- Place actions on the **same row as the page title**, far right.
- Do not use a row of full-width labeled outline buttons.

## Dialogs

- **Centered modals only** — never drawers, right sheets, or side panels for forms/import/filters/details-on-list.
- Dialogs may use most of the desktop (`maxWidth="md"` / `"lg"`, `fullWidth`, high `maxHeight`). Mobile can go full-screen.

```jsx
// ❌ BAD — side panel
<Drawer anchor="right" open={open}>…</Drawer>

// ✅ GOOD — centered, roomy
<Dialog open={open} fullWidth maxWidth="lg" scroll="paper">…</Dialog>
```
